00:00:18.918 --> 00:00:20.520
Update our viewers on exactly

00:00:20.520 --> 00:00:21.221
what is going on.

00:00:21.221 --> 00:00:21.688
Well, Wolf,

00:00:21.688 --> 00:00:23.456
