00:00:30.196 --> 00:00:31.364
They say it's fewer

00:00:31.364 --> 00:00:33.033
than a dozen documents,

00:00:33.033 --> 00:00:34.401
classified documents

00:00:34.401 --> 00:00:35.435
that were discovered

00:00:35.435 --> 00:00:37.670
in a office of the former,

00:00:37.704 --> 00:00:39.239
that the president had

00:00:39.239 --> 00:00:41.307
when he was setting up an office

00:00:41.474 --> 00:00:42.709
with the University of Pennsylvania,

00:00:42.709 --> 00:00:44.177
the Penn Biden Center

00:00:44.177 --> 00:00:45.779
