00:01:10.570 --> 00:01:11.471
Donald Trump,

00:01:11.471 --> 00:01:12.572
is now handling

00:01:12.572 --> 00:01:14.641
a review of these documents

00:01:14.641 --> 00:01:16.276
to determine what next to do.

00:01:16.276 --> 00:01:16.609
Of course,

00:01:16.609 --> 00:01:18.144
the FBI is also involved

00:01:18.144 --> 00:01:19.279
